          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"phase-1-tune-each-model-alone\">Phase 1 \u2014 tune each model alone</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A deterministic reduction turns serving metrics into a shared digest. Three\nspecialists read it and each either proposes a single-lever change or declares\nits lever <strong>dead</strong>. The arbiter spends the slots, weighted by whose predictions\nhave been holding up. Every outcome is recorded.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
