            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"phase-1-result\">Phase 1 result</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>model_a</strong>: p99 23,452ms \u2192 466ms (+98%), footprint 5.55 \u2192 0.82GB<br />\n<code>model_a[w=fp8,kv=bf16,seqs=256,tok=8192,cp=0,tp=2]</code></li>\n<li><strong>model_b</strong>: p99 1,542ms \u2192 378ms (+75%), footprint 2.56 \u2192 0.63GB<br />\n<code>model_b[w=fp8,kv=bf16,seqs=256,tok=8192,cp=0,tp=2]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Specialist calibration</strong> \u2014 the fraction of each agent's predictions that held, which is what the arbiter weights the next round by:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><code>arbiter</code>: 1.00</li>\n<li><code>batching</code>: 1.00</li>\n<li><code>parallelism</code>: 1.00</li>\n<li><code>quantization</code>: 0.50</li>\n</ul></span>"
