          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h3 id=\"verdict-reverted\">Verdict: reverted</h3>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">model_b breached SLO (4426ms vs 3000ms)</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Memory fit was never the binding constraint</strong> \u2014 the fit check cleared with 18.7GB spare. Device-time contention was: <code>model_b</code>'s p99 inflated <strong>+494%</strong> beside <code>model_a</code>, whose traffic is 94% prefill.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ulZA",
      "code_hash": "20d90018c8cc67191af504e76bdd5e16",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-control-arm\">The control arm</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Claiming the agents are better requires something to be better <em>than</em>. This\nsweeps the identical lever space, spends the identical budget, and passes the\nidentical gates \u2014 choosing randomly instead of by reasoning.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
